{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt visual novel that blends emotional storytelling with interactive gameplay.<br>After the passing of his beloved wife Merry, Richard\u2019s world is drained of all color, leaving him in a gray void of sorrow. Just when it seems he has lost everything, he discovers a letter containing Merry\u2019s <strong>seven final wishes\u00a0</strong>\u2014 a path that may lead him back to hope. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055750/extras/137d84a342bbb298acab3cda8744e1cd.webp?t=1772717989\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055750/extras/137d84a342bbb298acab3cda8744e1cd.poster.avif?t=1772717989\" class=\"bb_img\" width=620 height=146 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each wish fulfilled, the world slowly regains its colors. Through touching dialogue, evocative music, and a series of <strong>unique mini-games</strong>, players experience Richard\u2019s journey of grief, love, and healing. Every step forward paints his life with new meaning, reminding him that even in loss, beauty and hope can be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short but deeply emotional experience, crafted for players who enjoy <strong>visual novels with strong narratives</strong>, themes of love and loss, and a gentle mix of interactive elements. By the end, you\u2019ll discover that sometimes the smallest wishes can bring the brightest colors back into life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English. Additional languages are planned for the full release.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055750?t=1772717989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055750?t=1772717989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055750/63b46083d46a7c875c213535a147142db39cbfe8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772717989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055750/63b46083d46a7c875c213535a147142db39cbfe8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772717989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This is a serious dramatic story that explores heavy emotional themes such as grief, loss, and personal struggle. Some players may find the emotional subject matter emotionally intense."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt visual novel that blends emotional storytelling with interactive gameplay.<br>After the passing of his beloved wife Merry, Richard\u2019s world is drained of all color, leaving him in a gray void of sorrow. Just when it seems he has lost everything, he discovers a letter containing Merry\u2019s <strong>seven final wishes\u00a0</strong>\u2014 a path that may lead him back to hope. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055750/extras/137d84a342bbb298acab3cda8744e1cd.webp?t=1772717989\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055750/extras/137d84a342bbb298acab3cda8744e1cd.poster.avif?t=1772717989\" class=\"bb_img\" width=620 height=146 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each wish fulfilled, the world slowly regains its colors. Through touching dialogue, evocative music, and a series of <strong>unique mini-games</strong>, players experience Richard\u2019s journey of grief, love, and healing. Every step forward paints his life with new meaning, reminding him that even in loss, beauty and hope can be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short but deeply emotional experience, crafted for players who enjoy <strong>visual novels with strong narratives</strong>, themes of love and loss, and a gentle mix of interactive elements. By the end, you\u2019ll discover that sometimes the smallest wishes can bring the brightest colors back into life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English. Additional languages are planned for the full release.</p>","developers":["Midnight Shift Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055750/2ff9078c41f12cea7254d0fe25d001efd5708567/header.jpg?t=1772717989","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4055750/281347295/b7f7f2b26a6c23a31ef192d947033f7f56c6a950/1759390355/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760091402","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4055750/281347295/b7f7f2b26a6c23a31ef192d947033f7f56c6a950/1759390355/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760091402","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4055750/281347295/b7f7f2b26a6c23a31ef192d947033f7f56c6a950/1759390355/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760091402","id":257210571,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210571/0bd62f48bcabe770179b1bd6da749ecd0c359aa2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760091402"}],"name":"Merry\u2019s Seven Wishes","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (2.0 GHz) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent (DirectX 11 compatible)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows"